Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二十集 痛心时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎镜头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:24.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa! Heel, heel, heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:24.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎 跟着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dogs! No, dogs, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}跟着 狗狗 别去 狗狗 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真气人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Piggly squats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪丽斯库阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, piggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小猪猪 你们好呀 你们还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Piggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小猪猪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are the girls, they're very playful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是小姑娘 它们很贪玩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are all the pregnant mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些都是怀孕的猪妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was now early March,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是三月初 猪丽斯库阿特小猪崽狂潮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the explosion of newborn Piggly Squat piglets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was due to hit the farm at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随时会袭击农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you going to give birth?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们要生孩子了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Also, as it was March, Kaleb was busy with the spring crops
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}另外 因为现在是三月 卡莱布正忙着春耕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I'd come up with an idea which I thought might help him along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我想到了一个办法 我觉得可能会对他有所帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're running out of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们快没地方了 这里面存的是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What's in here? Fertiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}化肥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?什么玩意?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I bought a hovercraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我买了一辆气垫船
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你跟我解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, as you know, I love hovercrafts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道的 我喜欢气垫船
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:34.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My plan is... He doesn't know this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的计划是...他还不知道这事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know you're stunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道你很震惊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A little bit. - It's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有点 - 这是给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, as odd as that sounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然听起来很奇怪 但我并没有胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.88,0:01:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wasn't actually talking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}悬浮漫游车 农耕好选择
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hovercraft are making a bid to be the farmer's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}气垫船是农民最好的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no more of that dead weight on the axles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再也没有沉重的轮轴负担
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the truck moves with ease over the muddiest surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且卡车也可以 在最泥泞的路面上轻松移动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That means the farmer can get his work done when he wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着农民可以按其意愿完成工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}whereas with an ordinary tractor, it would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但若使用普通拖拉机 这是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now there's a hopeless position for you. Well and truly stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 你陷入了绝望的境地 车彻底卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Temper, temper!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}息怒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can always get one of those hover trucks with a bit of skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你一定要买一辆 有橡胶护舷的悬浮卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}剧终
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My plan was simple:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的计划很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if we used a hovercraft to spray the crops with fertiliser...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们用气垫船给农作物喷化肥...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then we could do away with the tramlines that normal sprayers need,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...那我们就不受普通喷雾器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所需的轨道的限制了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we could plant crops where those tramlines normally go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样我们就可以把农作物 种到车轨通常会经过的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did the calculation last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我昨晚算过了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how many miles of tramline there are on this farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道这个农场里的车轨有多长吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How many miles? - 54.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 多长? - 87公里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - 54 miles of tramline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 87公里的车轨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they're about that wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}轨道有这么宽 所以加起来...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:54.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that adds up to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I did the cost of lost crop. It's £5,200 a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我计算了损失农作物的费用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:03:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一年5200英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:03.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Wow. Now, with this, no tramlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}气垫船就能解决轨道的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Obviously, I then had to explain to Kaleb
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 接着我不得不向卡莱布解释 驾驶气垫船
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that operating a hovercraft is a bit more tricky
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比驾驶拖拉机要复杂一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}than driving a tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you've got two engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 气垫船有两个发动机 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is your lift engine,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是升降发动机 它会给橡胶护舷充气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that fills the skirt with air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then, once you've got the lift,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 你一旦升起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you start your right-hand engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就启动右侧的发动机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.96,0:03:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is your throttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.96,0:03:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是你的油门
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. It's not the brake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这不是刹车? - 现在...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. You have no brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 没有刹车
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right? You see, these are your handlebars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吗?你看 这些是你的车把
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You see they turn the flaps on the back. Okay, yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们会让后面的襟翼转动起来 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They make no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有刹车根本没影响
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. - Absolutely no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 一点影响都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you see an obstacle, and you do that, you're going to hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你看到障碍物 然后这样 你会撞上去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You have to lean. So basically, you're either like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你必须倾斜身体 所以基本上 你要这么骑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You sort of lean, get right over like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得稍微倾斜 向右一点 就像这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:51.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that steers it? - And that will make it go right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那样就能掌控方向? - 这样就能让它右转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, get over like that, and that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后像那样倾身 这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get as much weight as you can, as far over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽可能将重量移到尽可能远的地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that'll steer it. - And that'll steer it along with...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那样就能掌控方向了 - ...这样就能利用车把...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:03:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That. - The handlebars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:03:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那样 - ...控制方向了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But effectively, you've no braking and no steering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但实际上 你没有刹车和方向盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. Can I have a go before I start spraying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在开始喷化肥前 我能试试吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, I think that's a very good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然 我觉得这是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This feels so good, telling you what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}由我告诉你怎么做感觉真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, now it's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在出发了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:19.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...倾斜身体
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on... I'm leaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等...我在倾斜着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, man, you're supposed to going in a straight line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你应该直线行驶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样没用 这像环形交叉路口一样弯弯绕绕的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's as straight as a roundabout!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在...转弯!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}倾身!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Lean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lean and power!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}倾身 使劲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My young apprentice is doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的小徒弟做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我会了 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fallen out. He's fallen out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}掉下来了 他掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, you clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I need to learn this shit, I'm going spraying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得学会驾驶这玩意 我要喷化肥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Turn, turn, turn, turn, turn, turn, turn, turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You see, it's just gliding over the weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 它在小麦上滑行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Turn, turn, turn. No... Turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}转弯 现在转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We get the spray fitted, fertiliser applied.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们安装好喷雾器 放好化肥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Turn, turn, turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All we need to do is teach him how to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要教他如何停车
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the driving lesson successfully concluded,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随着驾驶课程圆满结束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was time to test the hovercraft as a crop sprayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是时候测试使用气垫船 给农作物喷化肥的效果了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:43.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Tell you what, you look like a shit gimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟你说 你看起来好蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is liquid... Fertiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是液体...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.64,0:05:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是化肥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Liquid nitrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}液体硝酸 极具腐蚀性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:53.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. It's phenomenally corrosive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once Kaleb had finished filling my bespoke fertiliser tanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布灌满我定制的化肥罐后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:05:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}美娜特级甜芒果酸辣酱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we were ready for the off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经准备好开工了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go ahead, my young apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出发吧 我的小徒弟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it's spraying, it's spraying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在喷了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm getting good at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开得越来越好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, this isn't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 还不错 现在再往左倾一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now just go a little bit to the left of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 这就来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But then, after exactly 75 seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但然后 就在75秒后...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb, is there any spray coming out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布 有化肥喷出来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, for fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真糟心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就没了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:06:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I'm empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:06:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}喷完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And how big's this field? - 20 acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:02.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这块田有多大? - 八公顷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many times are you going to have to refill with fertiliser?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得加多少次化肥?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.44,0:07:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er-- 25 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.44,0:07:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}25次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's going to take me about 8 hours to spray this field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得花八个小时 才能给整块地喷完化肥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That means I've got to spend 8 hours in this gimp suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着这套衣服 我得穿八个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we stick to the sprayer, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得还是用喷雾器吧 求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you please undress me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能帮我脱衣服吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}停
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Clearly, I needed bigger fertiliser tanks on the hovercraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 我需要给气垫船 准备更大的化肥罐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:40.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which meant it would need more powerful engines
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着它需要更强劲的发动机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to deal with the extra weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以应对额外的重量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That was a big job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是一项艰巨的工作 现在可没时间处理
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there was no time to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because the next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为第二天 冬天回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}winter came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then the next night,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后第二天晚上 我们从猪窝里的摄像头看到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}our feed from the cameras in the pigloos
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}suggested one of the Mums was about to give birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一个猪妈妈快要生产了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's see how she's getting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们去看看它的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, there's an actual piglet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看 是一只真正的小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's her first baby ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的第一个猪宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:52.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I think we've got a problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得现在出了个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Concerned that the piglet was not finding a teat to drink from,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎担心小猪崽找不到奶头喝奶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:09:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa went in to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:09:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是她进去帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh my gosh, there's a teat, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 那儿有一个奶头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, she's on the teat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在吃奶 很好 小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:11.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's March 10th, it shouldn't be this cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:11.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天是3月10日 不应该这么冷的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:12.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The climate is changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}气候在变化 有人需要...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Somebody needs to mention that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要提一下天气 因为这真的很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it's really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:24.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the best bit of farming I've had so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我迄今为止最棒的农场体验
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many will we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会有多少只小猪崽?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many teats has this one got, 16?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这头有多少个奶头?十六个?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah, that's 16. - So she could have 16 piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 有十六个 - 所以她可以生十六只
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This joy, however, soon turned into concern
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 这份喜悦很快就变成了担忧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because over an hour went by
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为一个多小时过去了 她没有再生出小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and no more piglets appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on. Come on Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油啊 猪妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一只可不够
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, you can do it. Come on.
