Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}瑞士猪本来应该要生十只 或十二只 或者十六只小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that promised to deliver 10 or 12 or 16 piglets
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and delivered only three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果只生了三只 现在 我们的猪小队
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now we've got Unit Pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was-- How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那...那是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:37.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was literally talking to the camera man for two seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚跟摄影师聊了两秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've looked back in there and there's another one come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后回头一看 又一只小猪出生了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a good pig, she's birthing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是头好猪 它生得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa arrived just in time to see Unit pop number three out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎及时赶到 看到了猪小队生出三号宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又生了一只
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:55.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on out. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出来吧 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}By the end of the morning, Unit had produced ten piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到上午结束时 小队生了十只小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And because she was an experienced Mum who'd had litters before,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它以前生过崽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.28,0:18:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}she seemed to know what she was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.28,0:18:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它似乎知道自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done, Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好 猪妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, when we checked in later on...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 当我们稍后查看情况时...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got one, two, three, four,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有一、二、三、四 五、六、七、八、九只
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:24.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}five, six, seven, eight, nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't bear it. Another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又一只
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's obviously squidged it. Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 显然它把小猪压死了 对吧? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We then went to check on the other Mums.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们去查看其他猪妈妈的情况...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then this is eight left. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后这是剩下的八只... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because two died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...因为死了两只
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's only seven. She can't have killed another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这只有七只 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它不会又压死了一只吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, for fuck's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真是够了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh my God, that's so upsetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 太让人沮丧了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.32,0:19:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bottom line, we'd now lost four piglets
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.32,0:19:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 我们现在失去了四只小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:08.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as well as three of the five surprises that had come along
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加上两个月前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}just over two months earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}意外收获的五只中的三只
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, they're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Seven piglets have died. Out of?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 七只小猪崽死了... - 本来总共有...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:23.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Twenty-eight. A quarter of them have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}二十八只 其中四分之一都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are we doing wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们做错了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Worried that we were indeed making some terrible mistake...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们担心自己在犯一些可怕的错误...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嘿 你好吗? - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Vanessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 瓦内萨 - 我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We consulted our neighbours, Vanessa and Andy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我们咨询了邻居瓦内萨和安迪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who'd been pig farmers for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们养了很多年的猪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seven piglets, 25% of the piglets have been squashed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}七只猪崽 25%的猪崽被压死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- which is a lot, isn't it? Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很多只 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I mean, how...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}的确 但我的意思是 怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mothers sitting on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 猪妈妈们坐到它们身上了 - 好吧 这并不罕见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. I mean, it's not uncommon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:20:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They are classically terrible mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:20:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是典型的坏妈妈 它们...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.88,0:20:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Some are worse than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.88,0:20:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 - 有些品种比其他的更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This breed is classically terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个品种尤其糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 我是说... - 对 总的来说 猪都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, and pigs in general just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One thing about the arcs is that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就猪窝而言
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if they're in a big house altogether with other sows,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果它们在一个大房子里 和其他母猪住一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the other sows do sort of tell the one who's sat on her piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其他母猪会告诉 坐到自己猪崽的猪妈妈...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They will make some fuss. They notice it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 顺便说一句... - 它们会非常生气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you've got a bad mother, the others will tell them it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们不会...它们会注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果有一个坏妈妈 其他母猪会告诉它们的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.44,0:20:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having processed this information,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.44,0:20:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}了解了这些信息后 我们跟卡莱布聊了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we then spoke with Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The biggest problem is, the piglets are cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最大的问题是猪崽很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, when the Mum lays down...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当猪妈妈躺下时...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The Mum stands up to go and eat, the piglets are going: "Fuck, it's cold."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪妈妈会站起来吃饭 小猪崽会觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's cold, so they find each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“妈的 好冷”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then the pig comes back in, the sow comes back in,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会寻找彼此 然后找到大猪 母猪回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then they find the warmth automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后它们就会自动找到温暖源
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So when the pig starts to lay down,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以当猪躺下时 它们会试图尽快接近温暖源
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- it's trying to get near the warmth ASAP. Of the pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 接近大猪 - 你明白我的意思吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you see what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It was bloody cold last night. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 昨晚真的太冷了 - 那是主要问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this is why you're losing so many piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是为什么你失去了这么多小猪崽 不是因为你养得不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not because you're a bad pig farmer, you're really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你真的很棒 我是客气一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'm being nice. You are good. You are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你很好 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So now we knew why the piglets were dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我们知道小猪崽的死因了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:08.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but we couldn't work out what to do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们不知道该怎么解决
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that night, we lost another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那天晚上 我们又失去了一只
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we had a new problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我们遇到了一个新问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because the remaining pregnant sow was showing absolutely no sign
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为剩下的怀孕母猪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of giving birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全没有表现出任何要生产的迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:29.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Her milk hasn't even come down. How can she be so far behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的奶水甚至都没流下来 它怎么能晚那么久?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She could be barren.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它可能难孕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shall we call her Barren?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要叫她“男爵”吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Baroness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}男爵夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, this is your favourite one, this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是你最喜欢的那头 - 对 这是我的朋友 它很温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, this is my friend. She's so gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:41.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's very lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:45.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She was also eating very little,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它也吃得很少
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:48.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we called out Jenny the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们请来了兽医珍妮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is our poorly pig. She's very sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是我们可怜的小猪 - 它很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I hear she's not eating very well, so that can't be good for anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我听说它吃得不太好 这对任何人都不是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It means we should hopefully be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这意味着希望能... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:22:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Doubtless, Lisa will now arrange for it to be taken away in a luxury ambulance
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:22:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}毫无疑问 丽莎现在 会安排它坐上豪华救护车
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and put into a kind of pig nursing home
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并将它送进猪猪疗养院...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with streaming television to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}能看流媒体电视的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's had that food in front of her now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它面前的食物已经 在那里放了12个小时了?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for 12 hours or more. 18 hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能更久?18个小时?它... 它坐在那里 一动不动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:20.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And she kind of sits there, and she doesn't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.08,0:22:22.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She kind of puts her tongue out, almost, and takes a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.08,0:22:22.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会伸出舌头 舔一点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.80,0:22:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She snuffles up a bit, she doesn't eat like a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.80,0:22:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}呼吸不太通畅 不像猪那么吃东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, which makes me think that something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 因此我觉得...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.80,0:22:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有些不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.96,0:22:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- She does look really not very happy... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.96,0:22:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它确实看起来非常不开心...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...in the way she's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - ...你可以从它的动作看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's got a rasp in her breathing when you're listening to her lungs,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的呼吸带点哑音 听它的肺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I'm wondering whether she's got a touch of infection going on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我在想它是不是被感染了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.92,0:22:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what I probably will be inclined to do
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.92,0:22:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我可能会给它一些消炎药
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.44,0:22:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is give her an anti-inflammatory, give her an antibiotic,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.44,0:22:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给它注射抗生素 看它情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.28,0:22:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}see how she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.64,0:22:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry, darling, you're not going to like this very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.64,0:22:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抱歉 亲爱的 你不会喜欢打针的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:51.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, she's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.20,0:23:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's pregnant, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.20,0:23:03.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它怀孕了 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She definitely looks really heavy down low,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它下半身确实看起来很重
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which suggests that she might be pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这在某种程度上表明它可能怀孕了 所以这很好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.52,0:23:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that's good. Good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.52,0:23:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.52,0:23:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Thanks, Jenny. - Let us know if she's not getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.52,0:23:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谢谢 - 如果它没有好转 给我打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.16,0:23:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.16,0:23:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While we were waiting anxiously for Baroness to go into labour,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们焦急地等待男爵夫人生产时
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.60,0:23:25.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}bigger events were unfolding around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.60,0:23:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们遇到了更重大的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Down at West Oxfordshire District Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在西牛津郡议会 一名政府督察员已经到达
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.36,0:23:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a government inspector had arrived to adjudicate on our appeal
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.36,0:23:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以就我们 对强制执行通知的上诉进行裁决
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}against the enforcement notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}西牛津郡议会会议 主题:迪丽斯库阿特农场上诉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'd been advised not to attend,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人建议我们别参加
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so instead, we went into overdrive
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 我们开始全力以赴地 确保农场商店里的所有东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to make sure everything in the farm shop was super local,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都是当地生产 符合议会要求 并且完全合法
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.96,0:23:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}council compliant and completely above board.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This... Ned, who works for us, he's just turned sixteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为我们工作的内德刚满16岁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.00,0:24:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}these are his biscuits, he makes them on his own kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.00,0:24:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是他在他的小厨房里做的饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.56,0:24:03.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Granola, that's a girl down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.56,0:24:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}格兰诺拉麦片 路那头的女孩做的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.32,0:24:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Flour comes from that field over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.32,0:24:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}面粉产自那边的田地
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.28,0:24:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are all made up in our kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.28,0:24:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是...这些都是我们的厨房做的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This, a neighbour down the road makes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去角质皂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一位邻居做的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.88,0:24:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This... This is Mrs. Viktor. Viktor does our honey,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.88,0:24:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是...这是维克托夫人做的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.88,0:24:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}维克托给了我们蜂蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.64,0:24:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And Mrs. Viktor makes her soap using our honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.64,0:24:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}维克托夫人用我们的蜂蜜做了香皂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.96,0:24:20.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is using--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.96,0:24:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是用我们的辣椒做的美味肉干
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Our delicious jerky
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}using our chillies again. We're growing more chillies this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们今年种了更多辣椒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:28.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are made in Chipping Norton from a local baker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是奇平诺顿的 一位当地面包师做的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This... This is made using our wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些...这是用我们的小麦做的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Err... Over here this is our gin. That's made in Burford.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这边 这是我们在巴福德酿制的琴酒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.36,0:24:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The pottery is made from a local lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.36,0:24:38.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}此陶器是当地一位女士做的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.00,0:24:40.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is our past chilli...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.00,0:24:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我们以前的辣椒...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.00,0:24:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The programme's only 40 minutes long and you've been 28 minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.00,0:24:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道整个流程只有40分钟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.12,0:24:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shush then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.12,0:24:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而你已经介绍了28分钟了 - 那就不说了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Of equal importance was the future of the burger van
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}汉堡车的未来也同样重要
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.44,0:24:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because with no restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.44,0:24:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为没了餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.16,0:24:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this had become the only way of selling our beef and pork at a profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.16,0:24:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它是我们销售牛肉和猪肉 以赚取利润的唯一方式
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.04,0:24:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I need a burger and a truffle and parmesan for this, chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.04,0:24:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大厨 我需要一份汉堡 搭配松露和帕尔马芝士
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.64,0:25:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Annie, who runs the van, had been to the council hearing that day
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.40,0:25:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}负责经营餐车的安妮 那天去参加了议会的听证会
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.36,0:25:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to plead the case for her business to stay open.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.36,0:25:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为继续营业辩护
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.48,0:25:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Vomit, what's it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.48,0:25:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全盘托出吧 情况怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.76,0:25:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a big room, and then there are,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.76,0:25:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是一个大房间 在房间后面
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.12,0:25:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}at the back of the room, sort of, twelve rows
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.12,0:25:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有大概12排 每排八个座位
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.96,0:25:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of eight across seats with an aisle down the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.96,0:25:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}中间有一条过道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.28,0:25:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then you've got the council on one side with their legal representation,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.28,0:25:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后一侧坐着议会及其法律代表
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.48,0:25:27.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then the guy presiding over the top of all looking down at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.48,0:25:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后主持整个流程的人坐在高处
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.68,0:25:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}远远地向下看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.40,0:25:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Has he got a beard? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.40,0:25:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他有胡子吗? - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.40,0:25:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.40,0:25:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.44,0:25:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.44,0:25:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人要走进去 我迟到了几分钟 因为严重缺乏停车位
