Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.68,0:29:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So all we could do was get back to farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.68,0:29:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们只能回到农场继续工作
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.80,0:29:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Except we couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.80,0:29:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而我们没法工作
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.56,0:29:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In mid-March, it started to rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.56,0:29:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三月中旬开始下雨 而且一直不停
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.84,0:29:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it didn't stop for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.84,0:29:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下了好几天
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.56,0:29:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This hit Kaleb especially hard
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.56,0:29:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这对卡莱布的影响尤其大
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.12,0:29:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it was too wet to plant his most valuable crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.12,0:29:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为太潮湿 无法种植他最有价值的作物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The durum wheat is our big money crop,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}硬质小麦是我们最赚钱的作物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.76,0:29:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it could pull a lot of money, especially for my board this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.76,0:29:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尤其是对我今年的开支来说 这能赚很多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.96,0:29:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it might potentially be profit and loss, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.96,0:29:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要知道 它可能会决定最终的盈亏
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:45.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've grown it for the last two years and we've seen how good it can be,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:45.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过去两年 我们都种了这种作物 看到了它的收益有多好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.20,0:29:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but annoyingly you need to get it in in perfect timing
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.20,0:29:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但恼火的是 你需要在完美的时机完成种植
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.56,0:29:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because if you don't, it suffers through the summer
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.56,0:29:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为如果把握不好时机 它会受夏季影响
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.48,0:29:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then the yields are normally down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.48,0:29:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后收益通常会下降
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.28,0:29:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hum... I wanted to... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.28,0:29:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想...对
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:29:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's never going to stop raining, I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:29:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得这雨就停不下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.92,0:30:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The endless wetness meant we couldn't work on the dam either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.92,0:30:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}无止境的潮湿天气 也意味着我们不能在堤坝工作
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:05.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全没机会
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.04,0:30:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a lot of water, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.04,0:30:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}水很多 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.20,0:30:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's basically washed the clay away, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.20,0:30:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}基本上 黏土都被冲走了...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.08,0:30:12.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we've got to wait for the water to go down. We cannot...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.08,0:30:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们必须等待水位下降 否则我们不能...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.12,0:30:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.12,0:30:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.12,0:30:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.84,0:30:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wanna go farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.84,0:30:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想去种田
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.32,0:30:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't, it's raining. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.32,0:30:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不行 在下雨呢 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.76,0:30:37.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was though some good news from the pig wood,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.76,0:30:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但猪猪树林传来了一些好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because thankfully there had been no more piglet deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为值得庆幸的是 没有再出现小猪崽死亡的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.80,0:31:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Baroness, though, still hadn't gone into labour.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.80,0:31:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但男爵夫人还没有生产
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.12,0:31:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And despite a week of antibiotics, she was clearly no better.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.12,0:31:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管已经用了一周的抗生素 它仍然没有好转
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.04,0:31:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Slept outside last night because she's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.04,0:31:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它昨晚睡在外面 因为它太热了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.76,0:31:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's not eating at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.76,0:31:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它根本不吃东西
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.32,0:31:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what we're doing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.32,0:31:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不知道我们做错了什么 - 是某一步错了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.12,0:31:25.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.08,0:31:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.08,0:31:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是觉得这...让人伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.28,0:31:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.00,0:31:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's heart-breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.88,0:31:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, Jenny's here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.88,0:31:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珍妮来了 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.52,0:31:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Still unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.52,0:31:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还是不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.24,0:31:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.24,0:31:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.12,0:31:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- She slept outside last night. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.12,0:31:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它昨晚在外面睡的 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.04,0:31:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So her temperature went down probably because she slept outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.04,0:31:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它的体温下降了 可能是因为它昨晚在外面睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.88,0:31:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. But her breathing is laboured.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.88,0:31:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我会带... - 仍然呼吸困难
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.32,0:31:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I'll take the second temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.32,0:31:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们将采取第二个方案
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.64,0:31:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but it could be that if she's got pregnant
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.64,0:31:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果它怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.20,0:31:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then had the piglets die inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.20,0:31:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而小猪崽死在了它的肚子里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they might not be triggering her to give birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那样不会促使它分娩
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.56,0:31:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but they might be sitting there,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.56,0:31:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但小猪崽会一直待在它肚子里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:31:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- rotting inside her. - What do you do in that situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:31:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 烂在它体内 - 如果是这种情况 你会怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.56,0:32:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Possibly try and induce her so she'll kick them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.56,0:32:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或许可以试着引产 让它把小猪崽生出来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.40,0:32:07.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Without more ado, we began the inducement procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.40,0:32:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}话不多说 我们开始了引产流程
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.16,0:32:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If the piglets are dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.16,0:32:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果猪崽死了 那么我们就专注于让它康复
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.00,0:32:12.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then we'll just concentrate on getting her well again,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.96,0:32:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and then... - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.96,0:32:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 让它康复 好的 - 然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.12,0:32:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Behind the ear. Inject.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.12,0:32:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}耳朵后面 扎进去...注射
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.40,0:32:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that it? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.40,0:32:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就这样? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.36,0:32:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So three o'clock tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.36,0:32:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这个点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.72,0:32:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with the second injection, which you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.72,0:32:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也就是明天三点的时候 注射第二针 你来注射
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.64,0:32:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.64,0:32:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 我可以
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.76,0:32:30.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It only should be a small amount, not like that big antibiotic injection.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.76,0:32:30.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}应该少量注射 不像注射抗生素那样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.60,0:32:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.60,0:32:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那量很大 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.76,0:32:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you've only got a small amount and it should go really easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.76,0:32:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你要少量注射 应该很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.88,0:32:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.88,0:32:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.28,0:32:45.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm going to give her this
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.28,0:32:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要给它注射这一针
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.84,0:32:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then in four to twelve hours' time,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.84,0:32:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后在4到12小时后 它应该就会开始生产了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.52,0:32:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}she should be starting to give birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go. Oh, my God, hello my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.84,0:32:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.84,0:32:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 你好 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:33:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:33:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}注射完毕 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.60,0:33:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}By late afternoon, the medicine started to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.60,0:33:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到了下午晚些时候 药物开始发挥作用
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.04,0:33:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and she gave birth to a piglet that was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.04,0:33:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它生下了一只活的猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.40,0:33:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But there were still problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.40,0:33:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但仍然存在问题
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.44,0:33:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the whole process has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.44,0:33:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它开始生产了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.24,0:33:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's given birth to one really small piglet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.24,0:33:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它生下了一只很小的猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.48,0:33:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She has no milk,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.48,0:33:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它没有奶水
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.28,0:33:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the piglet is in there just looking for a teat
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.28,0:33:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小猪崽在那儿找奶头 却没有食物
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.56,0:33:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and there's no food.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.24,0:33:32.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.24,0:33:32.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}情况怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.24,0:33:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's had one, she has no milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.24,0:33:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它生下了一只 但它没有奶水
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.12,0:33:37.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.12,0:33:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以看看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.80,0:33:38.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.80,0:33:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天啊 - 真的好小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.80,0:33:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's absolutely tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.92,0:33:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Have we got any pig milk? Like SMA? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.92,0:33:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有猪奶吗?配方奶粉之类的?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.96,0:33:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, that's not a healthy piglet, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.96,0:33:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只猪崽并不健康 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.52,0:33:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, veterinary clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.52,0:33:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里是兽医诊所
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.64,0:33:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Nathan? - Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.64,0:33:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 是南森吗? - 你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, it's Jeremy Clarkson up at Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 我是迪丽斯库阿特的 杰里米克拉克森
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.48,0:33:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.48,0:33:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 很抱歉打扰您
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.52,0:33:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry to trouble you. I gather both Dilwyn and Jenny are not there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.52,0:33:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道迪尔翁和珍妮都不在
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.28,0:33:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I'm troubling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.28,0:34:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以我只能打扰您了 我... - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.96,0:34:00.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I don't... That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.84,0:34:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know if you're up to speed on our sickly sow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.84,0:34:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道您知不知道 我们农场里生病的母猪的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.00,0:34:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's popped a piglet out that is the size of a mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.00,0:34:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它生出了一只小猪崽 但它只有老鼠那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.44,0:34:09.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's not producing any milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.44,0:34:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪妈妈没有奶水
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.60,0:34:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was wondering if you had any suggestions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.60,0:34:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想知道您是否有任何建议
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.16,0:34:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So basically, if she's not letting down any milk,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.16,0:34:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果它一点奶水都没有 一点都产不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.32,0:34:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's because she's not producing any.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, the next step is basically going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那下一步就是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.40,0:34:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}bottle feeding the piglets with some colostrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.40,0:34:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用奶瓶喂小猪崽初乳
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.88,0:34:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Colostrum? Where do we get colostrum from?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.88,0:34:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们该去哪儿买初乳呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.16,0:34:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I think in this case it would probably be easiest if we use
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.16,0:34:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我认为在这种情况下 最简单的是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.28,0:34:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a sort of pre-made lamb colostrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.28,0:34:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用一种预制羊羔奶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.36,0:34:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I think what we'll do is
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.36,0:34:33.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会放一些在诊所里 你可以过来拿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.96,0:34:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we'll put some up at the practice for you to collect
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.44,0:34:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it will be a case of following the instructions on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.44,0:34:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后按照说明书的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.32,0:34:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}mixing it up and bottle feeding the piglets with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.32,0:34:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进行混合 再用瓶子喂给猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.64,0:34:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, Nathan, thanks. Bye, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.64,0:34:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 南森 谢了 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.76,0:34:43.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No worries, take care now, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.76,0:34:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 保重 再见 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.36,0:34:48.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A member of the film crew went off to get the formula
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.36,0:34:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}摄制组的一名成员去拿配方奶了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.36,0:34:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then Kaleb arrived...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.36,0:34:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后卡莱布来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.60,0:34:52.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is she still trying to push? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.60,0:34:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它还在努力生吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.60,0:34:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just as Baroness gave birth to piglet number 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.60,0:34:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...此时 男爵夫人生下了二号猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.00,0:34:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! Yes, another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.00,0:34:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.68,0:34:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 另一只
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:34:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is there another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:34:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是另一只?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.88,0:35:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, we have another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.88,0:35:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 我们又多了一只 - 是活的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.32,0:35:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.52,0:35:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.52,0:35:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God, is that one even smaller? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那只是不是更小? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.32,0:35:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That one is unbelievably tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.32,0:35:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只小得令人难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.20,0:35:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"I'm fucking hungry!" I bet you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.20,0:35:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我他妈饿了!”我猜你们也饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.84,0:35:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This one is weak as hell, Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.84,0:35:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这只太虚弱了 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.84,0:35:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of them is as weak as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.84,0:35:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一只虚弱到了极点
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.00,0:35:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That runt, that little tiny one?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.00,0:35:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有...那只小的?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.56,0:35:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, the bigger one. She can't open her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.56,0:35:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 大一点的那只 它张不开嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.44,0:35:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's just, you know... Her head's flopping around on the nipple.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.44,0:35:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它就...头在奶头上晃动
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.60,0:35:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Luckily, the formula milk was now ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.60,0:35:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸好 配方奶准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.44,0:35:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.44,0:35:47.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.36,0:35:52.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's it. Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.36,0:35:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就这样 - 几乎...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.92,0:36:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.92,0:36:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.56,0:36:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.56,0:36:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完美
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.32,0:36:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll make you a big strong pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.32,0:36:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让你变成一头又大又壮的猪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.48,0:36:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll have you up and about in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.48,0:36:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们很快就会让你恢复健康的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.12,0:36:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then Nathan arrived and started to work vet miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.12,0:36:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后南森来了 开始创造兽医奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.32,0:36:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.32,0:36:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}生出来一只
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.84,0:36:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's okay? Yup, alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.84,0:36:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 活的? - 对 活的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.08,0:36:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go, another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.08,0:36:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 又一只
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.52,0:36:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.52,0:36:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 丽莎? - 怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.76,0:36:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many now? Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.76,0:36:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 现在几只了? - 四只
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.60,0:36:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are they all alive? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.60,0:36:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全都是活的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.96,0:36:31.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are they tiny? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.96,0:36:30.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 很小吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.84,0:36:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.16,0:36:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on. I've got another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.16,0:36:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等 好的 我又接生了一只
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.08,0:36:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Soon, Baroness was mother to five piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.08,0:36:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很快 男爵夫人成了五只猪崽的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.60,0:36:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just going to put them all next to Mum for a bit of warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.60,0:36:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把小猪崽们都放在猪妈妈身边取暖
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.08,0:36:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because he's a bit cold there. Just pop them all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.08,0:36:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为那儿有点冷 我们把它们放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.56,0:36:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And having bottle fed them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.56,0:36:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用奶瓶喂饱它们后 我们回家睡了一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.12,0:36:52.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we went home to grab a bit of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.16,0:37:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.16,0:37:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上 我们发现三只猪崽死了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.92,0:37:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we found that three of the piglets had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.12,0:37:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They'd simply been too weak to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.12,0:37:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们太虚弱了 无法生存
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.52,0:37:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We moved the remaining two to a heated pen at the farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.52,0:37:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把剩下的两只 移至农场的加热围栏里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.88,0:37:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but even that wasn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.88,0:37:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但即便如此都没用
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.64,0:37:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Another dead one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.64,0:37:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又死了一只
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.12,0:37:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.08,0:37:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is that the only one that's left? - We've got one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.08,0:37:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 只剩下那只了吗? - 我们还有一只
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How's the mother? Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪妈妈在哪儿?它还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.56,0:37:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.56,0:37:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.04,0:37:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're losing a lot of piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.04,0:37:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们失去了很多猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.08,0:37:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? We're losing a lot of piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.08,0:37:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 我们失去了很多小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.60,0:38:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's really tough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.60,0:38:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的很难 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this one, we just have to feed this one every 10 minutes or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只需要每隔十分钟喂这只一次
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.52,0:38:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't remember what the vet said.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.52,0:38:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每...我不记得兽医说了什么了 但...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.76,0:38:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come here, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.76,0:38:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.64,0:38:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've still got a feisty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.64,0:38:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们还有一只很活跃的小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.60,0:38:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is this the one that was born second?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.60,0:38:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是第二只出生的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've lost count. I honestly don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我已经数不清了 说实话我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.00,0:38:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll make it our life's mission to make that piglet survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.00,0:38:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让那只小猪崽活下来 现在是我们毕生的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.64,0:38:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.64,0:38:35.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 还有它的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.64,0:38:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.64,0:38:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The mother will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.64,0:38:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}妈妈会活下来的 我现在去看看它
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.28,0:38:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll go down and see her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.88,0:38:41.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You're going down?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.88,0:38:41.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.88,0:38:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That night we did what even the most hard-hearted farmer will do
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.88,0:38:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那天晚上 我们做了 即使是最铁石心肠的农民
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.28,0:38:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.28,0:38:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在这样的时刻也会做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.00,0:39:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.00,0:39:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油 喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.32,0:39:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We took the sickly piglet into our kitchen to look after it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.32,0:39:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把那只病弱的小猪崽 带到厨房里照顾它
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.36,0:39:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.36,0:39:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.28,0:39:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.36,0:39:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.36,0:39:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.36,0:39:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Still a bit small.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.36,0:39:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它还有点小
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.32,0:39:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's still a bit cold to be honest. Your ears are cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.32,0:39:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有点冷 说实话 你的耳朵很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.84,0:39:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, let's pop you back in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.84,0:39:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 我们把你放回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.48,0:39:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, get nice and warm. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.48,0:39:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 好好地 保持温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.28,0:39:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, I'm not going to put you in,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.28,0:39:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我不会把你放进去的 只是这里暖和得多 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.88,0:39:32.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- but it's just a lot warmer here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.28,0:39:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.28,0:39:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 对不起 好了 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.64,0:39:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.64,0:39:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特农场商店
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.64,0:39:45.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next day, irony of ironies,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.64,0:39:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天 非常讽刺的是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.20,0:39:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had to go to the farm shop to meet Andy Garcia the butcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.20,0:39:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不得不前往农场商店 去见屠夫安迪加西亚
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.28,0:39:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's lots of it. Let's take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.28,0:39:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 有很多 我们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.16,0:39:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He'd finished preparing the pigs I'd recently taken to slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.16,0:39:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他已经准备收拾好 我最近带去屠宰的猪了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.00,0:40:00.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seven boxes, two pigs' worth of pork in these.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.00,0:40:00.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}七个盒子 这里是两头猪的猪肉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.48,0:40:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You should be doing the lifting, really. They're your pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.48,0:40:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}应该是你去搬东西 这是你的猪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.92,0:40:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're young and I've seen you hold a pram
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.92,0:40:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你很年轻 我见过你 一手推着婴儿车 一手拿着枪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.12,0:40:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- while aiming your gun at Al Capone. - Look at that. This is your favourite.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.12,0:40:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看看那个 那是你的最爱 - 艾尔卡彭
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.32,0:40:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are belly pork strips. Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.32,0:40:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对啊 这些是五花肉条 - 好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.36,0:40:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pork chops there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.36,0:40:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是猪排 但你可以看出 它们真的是好猪...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.16,0:40:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can tell they're really nice pigs because of the amount of fat on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.16,0:40:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很棒的脂肪 - ...因为它们身上有脂肪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.12,0:40:21.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoever's looking after them is doing a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.12,0:40:21.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以无论是谁在照顾它们 真的做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.40,0:40:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... You can see that they're going to eat really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.40,0:40:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以看出它们吃得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.80,0:40:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lots of sausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.80,0:40:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很多香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy moly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:29.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天啊 - 卡罗莱纳死神辣椒和蜂蜜香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.04,0:40:29.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Carolina Reaper and honey sausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.28,0:40:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, my giddy aunt. There's another box.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.28,0:40:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我的天啊 - 还有呢 还有一箱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.56,0:40:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Two pigs have produced...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.56,0:40:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}两头猪就生产出了...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.44,0:40:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}4, 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.44,0:40:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}四、八...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.60,0:40:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Jesus! - There's 36 packs of six in a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.60,0:40:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一盒里面有36包 - 天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.52,0:40:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jeremy, Sandy and Black Forest Sausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.52,0:40:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 杰里米的桑迪黑猪森林香肠 - 听上去不错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.48,0:40:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sounds good. Sounds good doesn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.48,0:40:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听上去很不错吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.04,0:40:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is so good for my side of the chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.04,0:40:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这对我这边的数据来说真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.28,0:40:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God, strewth, that's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.28,0:40:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的 太棒了 除了...我...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.36,0:40:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Except it is so... One of the things I can't get my head around is,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.36,0:40:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一件事我无法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.80,0:40:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we're having a really tottering time with the piglet births.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.80,0:40:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在小猪的出生情况非常不稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.12,0:40:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.32,0:41:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Really tottering. Hmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.32,0:41:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的很不稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.64,0:41:03.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you're up all night, sort of nurturing these pigs and trying to make them warm,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.64,0:41:03.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你整晚没睡 培育这些猪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.28,0:41:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}trying to make them comfortable and trying to make them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.28,0:41:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}试着让它们过得温暖舒适
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.40,0:41:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.40,0:41:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 让它们活下去 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.96,0:41:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And then you break off...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.96,0:41:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 你休息一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.28,0:41:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...to come here and receive all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.28,0:41:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 来到这里收这些货 - 你太...这很难
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.64,0:41:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.64,0:41:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 心情复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.64,0:41:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mixed emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.96,0:41:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's only one expression I can think of, and it's farmer logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.96,0:41:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只能想到一种表达 那就是农民的逻辑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.60,0:41:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause you love animals. All farmers love their animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.60,0:41:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为你喜欢动物
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.36,0:41:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有农民都爱他们的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.16,0:41:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And then they kill them and sell them. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.16,0:41:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后他们把它们杀了卖钱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.96,0:41:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This way you can love them twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.96,0:41:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样 你就能爱它们两次了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.92,0:41:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Back at the farm, as the rain continued to fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.92,0:41:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回到农场 雨还没停
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.64,0:41:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I brought the poorly piglet into my office
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.64,0:41:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把可怜的小猪崽带到我的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.16,0:41:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I could keep an eye on her while I was working.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.16,0:41:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样我就能一边工作 一边关注它的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.56,0:41:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've moved her away from the Aga and brought her next to
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.56,0:41:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把她从AGA炉旁
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.08,0:41:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the stove in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.08,0:41:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}带到了谷仓的烤火炉旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.04,0:42:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And she's really not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.04,0:42:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的情况的确不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.32,0:42:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.16,0:42:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.16,0:42:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.64,0:42:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's the last one. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.64,0:42:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是最后一只了 - 我知道 加油啊 不行了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.00,0:42:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.84,0:42:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.88,0:42:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's okay, little one. I'm with you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.88,0:42:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没事 小家伙 我和你在一起 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.84,0:42:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can go, I'll stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.84,0:42:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以走了 我会留在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.60,0:42:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And her mother's not well either. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.60,0:42:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它妈妈的情况也不好 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.12,0:42:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's worse than she was before, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.12,0:42:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 它比之前更糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.12,0:42:36.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.12,0:42:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.12,0:42:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just find that heart-breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.12,0:42:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只觉得很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.08,0:43:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.08,0:43:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 珍妮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.08,0:43:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hi, Jenny. Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.08,0:43:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 珍妮 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.04,0:43:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Another familiar sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.04,0:43:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们好 - 又是熟悉的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.76,0:43:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've heard she's not doing well. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.76,0:43:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我听说它不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.00,0:43:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.64,0:43:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I'm afraid she's passed. There's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.64,0:43:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 恐怕它已经死了 已经没有心跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.88,0:43:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did she come out very little? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.88,0:43:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但它出生时很小 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.32,0:43:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.32,0:43:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.92,0:43:30.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't do this. I can't have pigs anymore, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.92,0:43:30.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不行 我不能这样 我不能再养猪了 说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.36,0:43:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A nightmare. I like them too much. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.36,0:43:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是噩梦 我太喜欢它们了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.68,0:43:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Unbelievably, the torment wasn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.68,0:43:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}令人难以置信的是 折磨还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.08,0:43:53.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because we then had to turn our attention to Baroness,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.08,0:43:53.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们把注意力转向男爵夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.60,0:43:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}now that every single one of her piglets had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.60,0:43:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在它的所有孩子都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.56,0:44:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, darling. Hi, sweet pea.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.56,0:44:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 亲爱的 你好 小甜心
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.24,0:44:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.24,0:44:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 好姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.60,0:44:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.68,0:44:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you doing now, Jenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.68,0:44:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珍妮 你在那儿做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.16,0:44:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just taking her temperature, to see whether she has got a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.16,0:44:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只是测量下它的体温 我想看它有没有发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.84,0:44:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's very wobbly though.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.84,0:44:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它摇摇晃晃的 - 走路像喝醉了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.76,0:44:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's walking like she's drunk. She's really wobbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.76,0:44:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的摇摇晃晃的 - 是的 看起来...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.32,0:44:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.20,0:44:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can see her swaying from side to side.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.20,0:44:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以看到它左右摇晃
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.08,0:44:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She hasn't eaten. She's had a bit of water, and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.08,0:44:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 它还没吃东西 喝了一点水 仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.36,0:44:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can see on the back end. Her bum should be round with muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.36,0:44:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以看到在它的后面...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.20,0:44:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的臀部本来应该很好看 肌肉丰满
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.52,0:44:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's really straight up and down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.52,0:44:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在看起来有点笔直
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.96,0:44:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's obviously lost a huge amount of muscle there and support.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.96,0:44:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然失去了很多肌肉 无法支撑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.92,0:44:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the problem is, especially on this terrain,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.92,0:44:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题是 尤其是在这种地形上 它需要上下坡
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.64,0:44:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where she's up and down hills and it's all a bit lumpy bumpy,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.64,0:44:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这会有点颠簸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.56,0:44:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm really worried that she's going to get to the point
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.56,0:44:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的担心到了某个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.16,0:44:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that she's just going to go off those legs
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.16,0:44:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会腿软倒下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.64,0:44:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.20,0:44:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It could be something cancerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.20,0:44:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能是体内有癌变
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.24,0:44:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The other thing you could be dealing with
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.24,0:44:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一种可能
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.00,0:44:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is if you've got some damage to the liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.00,0:44:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是肝脏受到了损害 但这两种情况都无法...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.56,0:44:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Neither of which are...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.04,0:44:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Curable. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.04,0:44:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}治愈
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.80,0:44:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is she suffering now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.80,0:44:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 它现在痛苦吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.04,0:45:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Any animal that's not eating is not in a good state.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.04,0:45:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}任何不吃东西的动物都状态不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.00,0:45:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's so unsteady on her feet, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.00,0:45:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它站不稳 对吧? - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.96,0:45:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you don't make the decision now,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.96,0:45:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你现在不做决定
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.72,0:45:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have a feeling that we'll be in this position in another week's time
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.72,0:45:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有预感 一周后
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.64,0:45:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with her collapsed down the bottom of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.64,0:45:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它就会倒下...倒在林地里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.88,0:45:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If she's not going to get better and she's suffering,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.88,0:45:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果它不能好转 还一直受苦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.20,0:45:20.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's Dignitas time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.20,0:45:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那该让它安乐死
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.84,0:45:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.84,0:45:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.16,0:45:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if you want me to do the deed,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.16,0:45:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你想让我给它安排安乐死
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.80,0:45:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then I'll sort it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.80,0:45:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我会安排 然后你们需要
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.28,0:45:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then you'll need to get someone in to take her away
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.28,0:45:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人进去把它的尸体弄走 在一切完成以后
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.40,0:45:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- after everything's done. - When would you do the deed?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.40,0:45:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你什么时候动手?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.16,0:45:41.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can do it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.16,0:45:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在就可以
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.32,0:45:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if you would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.32,0:45:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你想的话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.84,0:45:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.84,0:45:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死 你觉得呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.08,0:45:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What do you think? I can give you a bit of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.08,0:45:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很乐意多给你一些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.52,0:45:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't want her to be unhappy, in pain, or to get sicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.52,0:45:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想让它不开心 也不想让它疼
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And then... - You don't want her to die either.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想让它病得更重 然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.84,0:45:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't want her to die with a broken leg having fallen down there
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.84,0:45:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你也不想让它死去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.32,0:46:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and just be all crumpled up and alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.32,0:45:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想让它跛着脚死去 摔倒在树林里...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.84,0:46:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}浑身瘫软 孤独一猪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. It's always a really difficult decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 这个决定很难...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.76,0:46:08.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.76,0:46:08.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 它太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.36,0:46:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She does seem like she's got a bit of a sweet nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.36,0:46:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它确实看起来挺可爱的...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.36,0:46:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's really sweet. She's always been the sweetest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.36,0:46:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 它真的很可爱 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.96,0:46:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.96,0:46:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它是最可爱的 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.56,0:46:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.48,0:46:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah? Time?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.48,0:46:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗?什么时候做?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.36,0:46:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's fine. You don't have to be present if you don't want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.36,0:46:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没关系 如果你不想的话 不必到场
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.12,0:46:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. I don't want to see it. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.12,0:46:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 我不想看
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.16,0:46:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不用到场
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.52,0:46:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Thanks, Jenny. - That's not a problem. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.52,0:46:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谢谢你 珍妮 - 没事 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.88,0:46:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bye, Baroness.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.88,0:46:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再见了 男爵夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.80,0:47:00.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.80,0:47:00.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.16,0:47:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.24,0:47:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, darling. Time's up, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.24,0:47:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 亲爱的 恐怕时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.08,0:47:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译: 匡思颖
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 杨婕
